    {
      "data": {
        "text": "\"I have created the file `consume_event.py` with the Python code to consume one message from a Google Cloud Pub/Sub subscription.\n\nTo use this script, you will need to:\n1.  Install the Google Cloud Pub/Sub client library: `pip install google-cloud-pubsub`\n2.  Set the `GOOGLE_CLOUD_PROJECT` and `GOOGLE_CLOUD_PUBSUB_SUBSCRIPTION` environment variables to your project ID and subscription ID, respectively.\n3.  Ensure your environment is authenticated to Google Cloud (e.g., `gcloud auth application-default login`).\n\"",
