      "data": {
        "text": "**Defining the Implementation**\n\nI've decided to move forward with Google Cloud Pub/Sub. Now, the main focus is getting the necessary provider identifier baked into the `publish_event.py` file. I'm prioritizing clarity and maintainability in the implementation.\n\n\n**Implementing the Python File**\n\nI'm now fully immersed in developing the `publish_event.py` file. I'm leveraging the `google-cloud-pubsub` library to publish JSON events. The code is structured to directly use environment variables `GOOGLE_CLOUD_PROJECT` and `PUBSUB_TOPIC_ID`. I'm integrating provider identifiers, so it's ready for Google Cloud Pub/Sub integration.\n\n\n",
